      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:pscelestinus.encomium.budge:1-31",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲙⲏ ⲙⲡⲉϩⲟⲟⲩ ⲛⲧⲁⲩϫⲡⲟⲕ · ⲁⲩϫⲡⲟⲟⲩ **ϩⲟⲃⲟⲗⲟⲥ** ⲛⲟⲩⲱⲧ ⲛⲙⲙⲁⲕ ·",
      "english": "In the day on which thou wast brought into the world, was not an obolus also made with thee?",
